# Environment Configuration Template
#
# USAGE:
# 1. Choose deployment version:
#    - Version 1 (Single Machine): cp .env.single-machine .env
#    - Version 2 (Distributed):    cp .env.distributed .env
#
# 2. For Version 2: Edit .env and customize the IP addresses
# 3. For Version 2: Copy .env to ALL machines
#
# See .env.single-machine and .env.distributed for full examples
